/-- p27063 — 27:C20. The exact constraints on the colour rank $m$, for an internal frame of rank $m+2$. The conjugate of the $k$-th exterior power is the $(m+2-k)$-th, so a generation distinct from its conjugate needs $m$ odd. On a Subject with $3\mid\p+1$ the triality scalar is a frame move of determinant one of the colour frame exactly when $3\mid m$. One generation holds every exterior power of the colour frame twice, with the index sum $2^{m-2}$, on the ranks $2$ to $408$. The two constraints leave the colour ranks congruent to $3$ modulo $6$. -/
