/-- p28025 — 28:X1. \textbf{The Koide ratio} is exactly $2/3$ given the quarter-turn naming B5, the cube-root generation orbit bisected at the quarter-turn ($\rho^2=2^{-1}$), an exact value rather than an unexplained empirical coincidence. -/
